	measure '_Exped. Cont.' = ```
			
			        CALCULATE(
			            IF(
			                MIN([_7WeekTarget] - [_Ship Cont.], [_ProdContQty]) > 0,
			                MIN([_7WeekTarget] - [_Ship Cont.], [_ProdContQty])
			            ),
			            'FACT Combined'[Data Source] <> "MB52"
			        )
			```
		lineageTag: 83c519f8-983c-40e2-9e0f-8f9cc818b85a

