	measure '_INV 3M FCST Cont' = ```
			
			        VAR ReferenceDate = CALCULATE(MIN('DIM Date'[Full Date]), ALLSELECTED('DIM Date'[Full Date]))
			        VAR EndDate = MAX('DIM Date'[Full Date])
			        RETURN
			            CALCULATE(
			                SUM('FACT Combined'[CombinedQty_per_ContQty]),
			                DATESBETWEEN('DIM Date'[Full Date], ReferenceDate, EndDate),
			                'FACT Combined'[Data Source]<>"MB52"
			            )
			```
		lineageTag: 8aadb181-8e18-4f22-bf37-b1ce48d99c91

