	measure _MB51 = ```
			
			        VAR MB51 =
			            CALCULATE(
			                SUM('FACT Combined'[Combined Qty]),
			                'FACT Combined'[Data Source] = "MB51",
			                'FACT Combined'[Data Source] <> "MB52"
			            )
			            +
			            CALCULATE(
			                SUM('FACT Combined'[Combined Qty]),
			                'FACT Combined'[Data Source] = "MB51 Offset",
			                'FACT Combined'[Data Source] <> "MB52"
			            )
			        RETURN
			            IF(MB51 > 0, MB51)
			```
