	measure '_Delta Combined Container' = ```
			
			        VAR ReferenceDate = IF(MAX('DIM Date'[Full Date])<Max('DIM Date'[Today]),MAX('DIM Date'[Full Date])+1,MAX('DIM Date'[Today]))
			        VAR EndDate = IF(MAX('DIM Date'[Full Date])<Max('DIM Date'[Today]),MAX('DIM Date'[Today])-1,MAX('DIM Date'[Full Date]))
			        RETURN
			            CALCULATE(
			                SUM('FACT Combined'[CombinedQty_per_ContQty]),
			                'FACT Combined'[Data Source] <> "MB52",
			                'FACT Combined'[Data Source] <> "MB51 Offset",
			                DATESBETWEEN('DIM Date'[Full Date], ReferenceDate, EndDate)
			            )
			```
